style='mso-tab-count:1'>      </span>− Working time : 48 hours/ week, 8 hours/day.
From 8 AM to 12 PM in the morning and from 1 PM to 5 PM in the afternoon, 
in which the midday break is from 12 PM to 13 PM, 
the afternoon break is from 3:00 PM to 3:15 PM. 
Sunday is weekly rest day.<o:p></o:p></span></p>

