mso-bidi-font-size:10.0pt;font-family:Arial'>Any matter, which has not been mentioned in 
this labor contract will be treated according to collective bargain agreement, salary scale, 
company regulation ( all were confirmed by government).
Incase these documents not yet issued, company will follow the labor law..</span></i><i><span
style='font-size:11.0pt;mso-bidi-font-size:10.0pt;font-family:Arial'><o:p></o:p></span></i></p>








